// BGEE / BG2EE / EET

BACKUP ~PH_KITMOD/backup~
AUTHOR ~phillikus~
VERSION ~1.0~

ALWAYS

	INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/Lib/fl#add_kit_ee.tpa~
  
END

